	],
	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nFexs3KOiTeGf2FCC",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 10, DX 13, IQ 15, HT 13, HP 15, WILL 17, PER 14, FP 17, SPEED 6.5, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 3. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nCQPxqgi1gyhHWrr-",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 60 (offense 32, protection 28), threat tier major, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "ndHLu51EKQI5Nbvfm",
			"text": "Deathly Bolt: Deathly Bolt (16): 6d burning, Reach Ranged. Stated as literal dice: the bolt is a property of the lich's art, not its arm. It costs the creature to cast, and a lich in its own lair has cheaper ways to spend you first."
		},
		{
			"id": "ncqR8wUyrVUk85rdT",
			"text": "Frightening Gaze: No attack roll and no active defense. Frightening Gaze (15): 1d-4 toxic, Reach Ranged, gaze. The attention of something that has already outlived your grandchildren. Fright Check at penalty; it uses this on the brave first."
		},
		{
			"id": "nro2c2vgX4_1AMpyj",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/lich.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "n2L5gviWG3iP2nsnG",
			"text": "Independent build total: 451 points of racial traits plus 32 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nuURlQ5sBzCWLZFzJ",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Lich (SRD 5.1); Lich (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nOr4ePJYzaRerbUl8",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nk7ukXcRB56O-MqpL",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 50 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nFbgtNA9Psusup45C",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nXFtJbLYeCwoEq39R",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "n_VXurWBdvZV5uDTR",
			"text": "The casting identity is carried by Magery 3 and the fatigue-costed attacks; a full spell list belongs to a character sheet, not a bestiary record, and the three attacks price what the rating can see of it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nPa7bZ08Yxm31MdSx",
			"text": "The phylactery is story armor, not points: the record prices the body you can fight, and the notes leave its return in the GM's hands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nUC8yXGr3fTn159j-",
			"text": "Perception runs a point behind its towering IQ — centuries of reading by candlelight."
		},
		{
			"id": "nBA73EF2eIJlUqq3n",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
